<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23852" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεκᾱνία</span></b> , ἡ,
		= Lat. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>decuria,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				6.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>measure</i> or <i>division</i> of land, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπέλων δ., δ. Κολπηνή,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				4.1675
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Lydia</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFay.</u>
				156
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1512
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πυροῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					894.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>guard-house of a decuria,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IGRom.
				3.1286
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Arabia</span>), <i>Princeton Exp. Inscr.</i><i><span class="en">
				636
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
